 "note":"Backstrap seared rare and sliced over buttered barley and kale, with a peppery cream sauce.",
 "how":"Venison backstrap seared rare and sliced over buttered pearl barley and kale, with a peppery cream sauce. Simmer 250g pearl barley in salted water for 35 minutes until tender, then drain. Wilt 1 bunch shredded kale in 40g butter and stir through the barley. Season 800g venison backstrap with cracked pepper and sear in a hot pan 3 minutes a side for rare, then rest 8 minutes. Add 150ml cream and 1 tsp cracked pepper to the pan and simmer 2 minutes. Slice and spoon over.",
 "shop":["250g pearl barley@Pantry","1 bunch kale@Produce","40g butter@Dairy","800g venison backstrap@Meat","1 jar cracked black pepper@Pantry","150ml thickened cream@Dairy"]}},
